          "detail": "Line 714: meeting `<header className=\"min-h-16 bg-slate-950/70 backdrop-blur-xl border-b border-white/10 ... justify-between\">`; right side (lines ~737-749) holds STT pill, E2EE pill, sidebar toggle button — quick theme toggle goes here top-right"
        },
        {
